        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-880, Rustic Pipe Cabinet Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe rustic feel of this cabinet handle styled to look like a pipe is much sought after. Its charm exudes from the shabby chic design. RK International's Pipe Cabinet Pull is available in 4 sizes: 3 inch, 5 inch, and 8 inch, and 10 inch. Choose from beautiful finishes like antique english, oil rubbed bronze, and satin nickel.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/cylinder-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-781\"><b>Pipe Cabinet Knob</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/pipe-appliance-pull-rk-international-ap-ph-4880\"><b>Pipe Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CP-880 Cylinder Middle Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material:Brass</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 4 sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>CP-880</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 3-19/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 19/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-15/32\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CP-881</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 5-19/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 19/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-15/32\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CP-882</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 8-19/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 19/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-15/32\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CP-879</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 10-19/32\"\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 19/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-15/32\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
